      "justification": "Captures the negative login outcome. Guard abstracts 'fails' to v_login='fail'. Modelling the condition as an action step is explicitly allowed and preserves flow."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_cont->i4",
        "action:i4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you want to try again, please provide the userdata for flickr."
      ],
      "justification": "First retry option after failure. Guard uses an abstract option label, action repeats the source step. Matches behaviour."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
