      "justification": "First abort option. Guard abstracts the choice, action states it, end captures termination. Preserved."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b_cont->i6",
        "action:i6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you still want to try again, please provide the userdata for flickr."
      ],
      "justification": "Second retry option, reflecting the source text's repetitive structure. Redundant but behaviourally identical to the first retry path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
